### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Create a task (copy the returned id into @id)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Buy milk" }

###
@id = paste-the-id-here

### Reword
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/{{id}}/description
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "Buy oat milk" }

### Add a checklist item (copy the returned id into @item)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/{{id}}/checklist
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Buy eggs" }

###
@item = paste-the-item-id-here

### Complete while the item is open → 409
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/{{id}}/complete

### Tick the item off
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/{{id}}/checklist/{{item}}/check

### Start
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/{{id}}/start

### Complete
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/{{id}}/complete

### Complete again → 409 Problem Details
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/{{id}}/complete

### Get one
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks/{{id}}

### List
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tasks
